            <section id="overview">
                <h2>Project Overview</h2>
                <p>The Mid-Continent Refinery Upgrade was a flagship project for Elite Industrial Services, involving the modernization of the plant's main distillation unit and the installation of over 5,000 linear feet of high-pressure process piping. As a critical facility for regional fuel production, minimizing downtime was a primary objective.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section id="challenge">
                <h3>The Challenge</h3>
                <p>The Mid-Continent Refinery Upgrade was a flagship project for Elite Industrial Services, involving the modernization of the plant's main distillation unit and the installation of over 5,000 linear feet of high-pressure process piping. As a critical facility for regional fuel production, minimizing downtime was a primary objective.</p>
                <ul>
                    <li id="challenge-1"></li>
