            <section id="solution">
                <h3>Our Solution</h3>
                <p>
                Elite Industrial Services implemented an off-site modular fabrication strategy. By fabricating major piping spools and equipment skids in our controlled facility, we reduced on-site labor requirements by 40% and significantly mitigated safety risks.</p>
                <ul>
                    <li><i class="fa-solid fa-hexagon-check"></i>Advanced 3D laser scanning for precise field measurements.</li>
                    <li><i class="fa-solid fa-hexagon-check"></i>Implementation of a dedicated on-site safety coordinator.</li>
                    <li><i class="fa-solid fa-hexagon-check"></i>Night-shift mobilization for critical heavy lifts during low-traffic periods.</li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <section id="result">
                <h3>The Result</h3>
                <p>The refinery upgrade resulted in a 12% increase in throughput capacity for the facility and a significant reduction in emissions. The client reported that the integration of the new systems was seamless, with the commissioning phase completed in record time.</p>
            </section>

